---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { products } from "../../data/products";

// Generic fallback plan — for buyers who skip the product picker or whose
// product isn't on the site yet. Real value, no dead end, links to all plans.
---

<Base
  title="Your 30-Day Ritual Plan | Pure Prana Ayurvedic"
  description="The universal 30-day plan for getting the most from any Pure Prana blend — dosing habits, weekly roadmap, and the mistakes that waste a bottle."
>
  <article class="plan">
    <header class="plan-hero">
      <span class="plan-icon">🌿</span>
      <h1>Your 30-Day Ritual Plan</h1>
      <p class="plan-intro">
        This is yours to keep — tap <strong>Save / Print as PDF</strong> below,
        or just bookmark this page. Welcome to Pure Prana.
      </p>
      <button class="plan-print btn-print" type="button">⬇ Save / Print as PDF</button>
    </header>

    <div class="plan-body">
      <section class="plan-card">
        <h2><span class="plan-num">1</span> How to take it</h2>
        <p>
          Take 2 capsules daily with food, at the same time every day. Most
          herbal blends absorb best alongside a meal — and a fixed time is what
          turns a bottle into a ritual. Check your label for any
          product-specific timing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="plan-card">
        <h2><span class="plan-num">2</span> Your 30-day roadmap</h2>
        <ul class="plan-roadmap">
          <li><strong>Days 1–3</strong><span>Lock in the habit. Put the bottle where you can't miss it — next to your coffee, toothbrush, or breakfast plate.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Week 1</strong><span>Your routine settles in. Traditional botanicals build gradually — consistency matters more than anything you feel yet.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Weeks 2–3</strong><span>This is when most people start noticing their blend's support working with their daily habits. Don't change anything — keep going.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Week 4</strong><span>Reassess vs. day 1 — and reorder before you run out. A 60-count bottle lasts ~30 days at 2/day.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="plan-card">
        <h2><span class="plan-num">3</span> Amplify it — 3 daily habits</h2>
        <ul class="plan-list">
          <li>Steady hydration — herbs work best in a well-hydrated body</li>
          <li>10 minutes of daily movement — a walk is enough</li>
          <li>A consistent sleep window — every system you're supporting recovers at night</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="plan-card">
        <h2><span class="plan-num">4</span> The 5 bottle-wasting mistakes</h2>
        <ul class="plan-list plan-list--warn">
          <li>Taking it on an empty stomach (poor absorption, wasted capsules)</li>
          <li>Skipping days — daily consistency is how botanicals build</li>
          <li>Quitting at day 5 because you don't "feel it" yet</li>
          <li>Doubling up after a missed dose — just resume your normal amount</li>
          <li>Storing the bottle somewhere hot and humid (like a bathroom shelf)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="plan-card">
        <h2><span class="plan-num">5</span> Get your blend's exact plan</h2>
        <p>Each Pure Prana blend has its own tuned version of this plan — dosing trick, weekly roadmap, and pairings:</p>
        <ul class="plan-links">
          {products.map((product) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`/free-wellnessplan/${product.slug}/`}>
                {product.icon} {product.name} plan →
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="plan-extra plan-bonus">
      <p>
        Want the bigger picture?
        <a href="/wellness-guide/">Get our free 15-page Ayurvedic Wellness Guide →</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .plan-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      var(--color-primary-light) 0%,
      var(--color-bg-warm) 100%
    );
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .plan-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .plan-hero h1 {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
  }

  .plan-intro {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .plan-print {
    padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .plan-print:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .plan-body {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .plan-card {
    background: var(--color-bg-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .plan-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .plan-num {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .plan-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .plan-roadmap {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .plan-roadmap li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .plan-roadmap strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .plan-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .plan-list li::before {
    content: "✓ ";
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .plan-list--warn li::before {
    content: "✗ ";
    color: #c0392b;
  }

  .plan-links {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .plan-links a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .plan-extra {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .plan-bonus {
    text-align: center;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .plan-bonus a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media print {
    :global(.site-header),
    :global(.site-footer),
    .plan-print,
    .plan-bonus {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .plan-card {
      break-inside: avoid;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .plan-hero h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll(".btn-print").forEach((btn) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => window.print());
  });
</script>
